Alias mode: only "show ip route"/"show ipv6 route" output is route JSON.
The regex "show ip|ipv6 route" matched every "show ip ..." command, so in
alias mode "show ip bgp summary" fed BGP JSON to the route-alias rewrite
and crashed (TypeError: object of type 'int' has no len()).

